<title>SPAIN: Spain details 1997 June budget deficit.</title>
<headline>Spain details 1997 June budget deficit.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Economy Ministry on Wednesday gave the following details of Spain's state deficit on a cash basis</p>
<p> BUDGET OPERATIONS	   JUNE 97	MAY 97	   JUNE 96</p>
<p> Revenues			1,290.8	 836.9	   1,203.5</p>
<p> Expenditure		   1,560.2     1,350.1	   1,584.1</p>
<p> Deficit/surplus		-269.4	-513.2	    -380.6</p>
<p> Deficit to date	    -1,236.4	-967.0	  -1,466.1</p>
<p>NOTE - The figures relate to central government finances only.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
</text>
